 "pdf_title": "SURVEY OF CRIME During the year under review, a total number of 7,51,615 cognizable offences (under the Indian Penal Code) were reported as against 7,59,013 in the year 1964. The crime has, therefore, shown a decrease of 0.97% as compared to the previous year. These figures also include crime committed by juveniles. The table below indicates the total cognizable crime reported, estimated population and volume of crime from 1960 to 1965. TABLE No. I",
